17. Short layman summary

If explained to a non-technical person:

"This project is a cancer-risk prediction demo app. It takes health and lifestyle inputs, uses two trained AI/ML models to estimate risk level, compares the models, and shows the result in a simple web interface. Behind the scenes, it includes the full process of preparing data, training models, saving them, and using them later for predictions."


